      "message": "Merge main into issue/533-wire-iso-post (solid_law_goldens.rs: take main's synthetic-marker guard; wire golden renamed to its own stem)\n\nMain (#1093) dropped the UNJUDGED list this branch had added the wire\ngolden to. The wire ISO golden is posted from wire_post.rs's own slug\ndocument, not from the wire_contour_punch.cl golden, so it is renamed\nnc/wire-iso/wire_slug_punch.nc; the posted-golden guard then reads it as\na golden posted from a document, which it is.\n\nRefs #533\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
