        "date": "2026-11-13T00:34:16Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(post): let the wire EDM post through the EDM door; add its script suite\n\nReview of #1139. Main's #1131 EDM door at post\n(`posting_family::edm_at_post`) refused every op on a wire EDM, so the\nwire post was unreachable. Its WireEdm arm now continues; SinkerEdm\nstays refused by name (#542). Doc comments at the door and its three\ncallers and `posting_serves` say so.\n\nPins (wire_post.rs): a wire setup missing each edm.codes.<x> is refused\nby that name through `post_script` with no file written; a Sinker Burn is\nrefused with the #542 text by every registry post.\n\nMain's per-script-suite law: crates/post/tests/script_wire_iso.rs with\nits recorded goldens (every recorded cutting stream is a named refusal).\n\nRefs #533\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
